      "desc": "Mapping and initialization of the 12B-parameter Flux ecosystem with segmented memory architecture.",
      "html": "<p style=\"font-size:.88rem;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">Flux requires precise segmentation between VRAM and host RAM. Using the flags <code>--vae-on-cpu</code> and <code>--vae-tiling</code>, we avoid out-of-memory (OOM) errors on the RX 580 2048SP. The T5XXL (fp16) and VAE reside in RAM; the diffusion model occupies VRAM.</p><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Homologated File</th><th>Final Allocation</th><th>Size</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Diffusion Model</td><td><code>flux1-schnell-q4_k.gguf</code></td><td><strong>GPU (VRAM)</strong></td><td>~6.5 GB</td></tr><tr><td>VAE</td><td><code>ae.safetensors</code></td><td><strong>CPU (RAM)</strong></td><td>~160 MB</td></tr><tr><td>CLIP L</td><td><code>clip_l.safetensors</code></td><td><strong>GPU (VRAM)</strong></td><td>~235 MB</td></tr><tr><td>T5XXL</td><td><code>t5xxl_fp16.safetensors</code></td><td><strong>CPU (RAM)</strong></td><td>~9.3 GB</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.9;margin-top:1.25rem\">⚠️ <strong style=\"color:#fff\">Stability Notes:</strong> Removing the <code>--timeout</code> flag (unsupported by the current version) and adding <code>--vae-tiling</code> eliminated <em>DeviceMemoryAllocation</em> errors. Total RAM usage reaches ~9.5 GB (T5XXL fp16). To save RAM, replacing it with <code>t5xxl_fp8</code> reduces it to ~5 GB.</p><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:.5rem\"><strong style=\"color:#fff\">Production Command (iniciar.bat):</strong></p><pre style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px\">sd-server.exe --listen-ip 0.0.0.0 --listen-port 7860 ^\n  --diffusion-model \"E:\\ia_storage\\models\\Stable-diffusion\\flux1-schnell-q4_k.gguf\" ^\n  --vae \"E:\\ia_storage\\models\\Stable-diffusion\\ae.safetensors\" ^\n  --clip_l \"E:\\ia_storage\\models\\Stable-diffusion\\clip_l.safetensors\" ^\n  --t5xxl \"E:\\ia_storage\\models\\Stable-diffusion\\t5xxl_fp16.safetensors\" ^\n  --cfg-scale 1.0 --steps 4 --clip-on-cpu --vae-on-cpu --vae-tiling</pre><div class=\"tbl\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem\"><table><thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>Real Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Conditioning (T5XXL)</td><td>11.49s</td></tr><tr><td>Sampling — 4 steps @ 1024x1024</td><td>~838s (~14 min)</td></tr><tr><td>VAE Decode — 9 tiles</td><td>40.45s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total per image</strong></td><td><strong>~838s (~14 min)</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.25rem; background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #22c55e;\"><span style=\"color:#22c55e; font-weight:bold\">✅ STATUS: SERVER IN PRODUCTION — IMAGE GENERATED SUCCESSFULLY</span><br><span style=\"font-size:.8rem; color:#94a3b8\">Listening on http://0.0.0.0:7860 | VRAM: 7.6/8.0 GB | RAM: ~9.5 GB | GPU: RX 580 2048SP | Temp: 66°C</span></div>"
